1
00:00:00,730 --> 00:00:03,790
(Sheldon:)Well, they can't cancel it.
It ended on a cliffhanger.

2
00:00:04,901 --> 00:00:05,961
Well, they did.

3
00:00:06,135 --> 00:00:07,965
(Penny:)There are two dumplings left.
Want them?

4
00:00:08,137 --> 00:00:11,227
(Sheldon:)Dumplings? Don't you understand
what's going on here?

5
00:00:11,441 --> 00:00:13,311
(Penny:)As a rule, no.

6
00:00:14,310 --> 00:00:18,040
(Sheldon:)That show ended with all the residents
of New York either dead or unconscious.

7
00:00:18,247 --> 00:00:20,577
(Sheldon:)Now I'll never know what happened.

8
00:00:20,817 --> 00:00:22,617
(Penny:)Why don't you make up
your own ending?

9
00:00:22,852 --> 00:00:25,082
(Sheldon:)Oh. Sure, what a wonderful idea.

10
00:00:25,321 --> 00:00:28,311
(Sheldon:)And after that I'll make up my own rules
of oral hygiene...

11
00:00:28,524 --> 00:00:31,614
...and instead of flossing,
I'll rub pudding on my gums.

12
00:00:31,794 --> 00:00:34,524
I'm gonna get the number of
the Syfy Channel and give them what for.

13
00:00:34,697 --> 00:00:36,217
(Leonard:)Oh, please don't do that.

14
00:00:36,432 --> 00:00:38,922
(Sheldon:)No. They can't just cancel
a show like Alphas.

15
00:00:39,135 --> 00:00:41,225
(Sheldon:)They have to help the viewers let go.

16
00:00:41,437 --> 00:00:43,927
(Sheldon:)Firefly did a movie to wrap things up.

17
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:47,110
(Sheldon:)Buffy the Vampire Slayer
continued on as a comic book.

18
00:00:47,343 --> 00:00:50,433
(Sheldon:)Heroes gradually lowered the quality
season by season...

19
00:00:50,646 --> 00:00:52,476
...until we were grateful it ended.

20
00:00:53,683 --> 00:00:55,613
(Penny:)I feel bad for whoever gets that phone call.

21
00:00:55,785 --> 00:00:59,015
Ah, don't. If they didn't wanna be
yelled at by crazy nerds...

22
00:00:59,188 --> 00:01:03,018
(Leonard:)...they shouldn't have started
a sci-fi channel.

